      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../QuerydslJpaPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.support\"><code>QuerydslJpaPredicateExecutor</code></a> from the given domain class and <code>EntityManager</code> and uses\nthe given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/EntityPathResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>EntityPathResolver</code></a> to translate the domain class into an <code>EntityPath</code>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的领域类和<code>EntityManager</code>创建一个新的<a href=\"../QuerydslJpaPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.support\"><code>QuerydslJpaPredicateExecutor</code></a>，并使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/querydsl/EntityPathResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>EntityPathResolver</code></a>将领域类转换为<code>EntityPath</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/support/RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a> based on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/core/RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> to add JPA-specific extensions.",
